# Leading slash: repo root only. An unanchored `models/` matches **any** directory of that name at
# any depth, which silently excluded src/KSubMaker.Domain/Models, src/KSubMaker.Infrastructure/Models
# and tests/KSubMaker.IntegrationTests/Models — ModelCatalog.cs, HttpModelManager.cs and friends.
# The old clone never noticed: ignore rules do not apply to files git is already tracking, so it
# only surfaced when the repository was re-initialised and those eight files went missing.
/models/
*.gguf
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.onnx

